      "that: (1) bu/şu, (2) relative (the book that I read), (3) fiil, sıfat veya isimden sonra açıklama cümlesi (I think that …, I'm sure that …, the fact that …), (4) so … that / such … that sonuç, (5) so that amaç, (6) It is … that vurgu.",
      "that cümleye açıklama eklemenin en sık yoludur. Fiilden sonra: say, think, believe, suggest, show, explain + that + tam cümle: Studies show that sleep improves memory. Konuşmada bu that çoğu zaman atlanır: I think (that) you're right. Sıfattan sonra: I'm sure / glad / afraid / aware that … İsimden sonra açıklama: the fact that, the idea that, the belief that (bunlar relative değil, ismin içeriğini anlatır). Özne olarak: That he resigned surprised everyone (yazıda; konuşmada It surprised everyone that he resigned). Sonuç: The room was so cold that we left. / It was such a cold room that we left. Amaç: I left early so that I could catch the bus. Vurgu: It was the price that bothered me. Önemli: that'ten sonra virgül konmaz; that bir cümle bekler (özne + fiil).",
